{
  "id": "E050",
  "title": "How Was Your Summer?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-09-14",
  "synopsis": "Do you want to get a tan? Nowadays there are many different activities you can do outside.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/232/213275c6b7f615c32344affb7108ce12c79ed3ba.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "这个夏天你忙什么了？ \n\n王丽：一个夏天不见，你怎么晒得这么黑！\n张平：我玩了一个夏天的飞盘呢！\n王丽：真的吗？你玩得怎么样？\n张平：玩得不怎么样。我接盘接得还行，但是扔盘扔得很糟糕。\n王丽：没关系，多练练会好起来的！\n张平：我也这么想。这个夏天你忙什么了？你看起来也晒黑了一点。你也常常在外面运动吗？ \n王丽：我玩了一个夏天的Pokemon！",
    "traditional": "這個夏天你忙什麼了？ \n\n王麗：一個夏天不見，你怎麼曬得這麼黑！\n張平：我玩了一個夏天的飛盤呢！\n王麗：真的嗎？你玩得怎麼樣？\n張平：玩得不怎麼樣。我接盤接得還行，但是扔盤扔得很糟糕。\n王麗：沒關係，多練練會好起來的！\n張平：我也這麼想。這個夏天你忙什麼了？你看起來也曬黑了一點。你也常常在外面運動嗎？ \n王麗：我玩了一個夏天的Pokemon！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": " \n\n",
      "traditional": " \n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What have you been up to this summer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王丽：一个夏天不见，你怎么晒得这么黑！",
      "traditional": "王麗：一個夏天不見，你怎麼曬得這麼黑！",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì yí ge xià tiān bú jiàn nǐ zěn me shài de zhè me hēi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: It has just been one summer since the last time I saw you. How come you have gotten so tanned!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "张平：我玩了一个夏天的飞盘呢！",
      "traditional": "張平：我玩了一個夏天的飛盤呢！",
      "pinyin": "zhāng píng wǒ wán le yí ge xià tiān de fēi pán ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Zhang Ping: I spent the whole summer playing frisbee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王丽：真的吗？你玩得怎么样？",
      "traditional": "王麗：真的嗎？你玩得怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì zhēn de ma nǐ wán de zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Really? Are you any good?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "张平：玩得不怎么样。我接盘接得还行，但是扔盘扔得很糟糕。",
      "traditional": "張平：玩得不怎麼樣。我接盤接得還行，但是扔盤扔得很糟糕。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng píng wán de bù zěn me yàng wǒ jiē pán jiē de hái xíng dàn shì rēng pán rēng de hěn zāo gāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Zhang Ping: Not very good. I am alright at catching the frisbee but terrible at throwing it."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王丽：没关系，多练练会好起来的！",
      "traditional": "王麗：沒關係，多練練會好起來的！",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì méi guān xi duō liàn liàn huì hǎo qǐ lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Don’t worry. You will get better when you have more practice!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "张平：我也这么想。这个夏天你忙什么了？",
      "traditional": "張平：我也這麼想。這個夏天你忙什麼了？",
      "pinyin": "zhāng píng wǒ yě zhè me xiǎng zhè ge xià tiān nǐ máng shén me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "你看起来也晒黑了一点。你也常常在外面运动吗？",
      "traditional": "你看起來也曬黑了一點。你也常常在外面運動嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn qǐ lái yě shài hēi le yì diǎn nǐ yě cháng cháng zài wài miàn yùn dòng ma",
      "english": "Zhang Ping: I think so too. What have you been up to this summer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You look a bit tanned too, have you also been doing sports outside?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "王丽：我玩了一个夏天的Pokemon！",
      "traditional": "王麗：我玩了一個夏天的Pokemon！",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì wǒ wán le yí ge xià tiān de 3",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: I spent the whole summer playing Pokemon!"
    }
  ],
